License: BSD-3-Clause, retained at flash-attention/LICENSE.
Copyright notices are retained in each upstream header.

The vendored subset contains the FlashAttention-2 forward headers.
flash_fwd_launch_template.h changes its CUDA exception header include to
cuda_check.h, a standalone CUDA error adapter. The remaining upstream headers
are unmodified. adapter.cu instantiates the upstream BF16, d128, dropout-free
64x64 forward path with an explicit causal flag and exposes a C host interface.
build.rs selects the native CUDA architectures. Q is strided
inside the packed QKV projection; K/V retain the engine's head-major cache.

